        441,
        1027,
        632
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "a. Where a certified employee organization has been or shall be duly designated or certified for a city-wide bargaining unit, during the period while such city-wide certified employee organization status remains in effect, authorizations of employees in such city-wide bargaining unit to deduct union dues will be given effect only as to the dues payable to such city-wide certified employee organization.",
